 "The Advertisement scheduler plays adverts and jingles in breaks: every so many songs or minutes, or at set times, and prints a schedule for each advert.": "",
 "The Adverts list is empty. Add adverts there first.": "",
 "The AzuraCast tool is optional. Now-playing info only needs the address and station; managing the station needs an API key.": "",
 "The Cart wall is a grid of pads for jingles, sound effects and drops: click a pad to play it over the music. Right-click a pad to give it a sound file, a name and a colour.": "",
 "The Jingles menu plays the first pads, stops all jingles, and brings the Cart wall back with Show cart wall.": "",
 "The Library panel on the left lists your tracks. Click ➕ Folder… to add a music folder; RadioMaster scans it and keeps it up to date (⟳ Rescan looks again).": "",
 "The Playlist generator builds playlists from your music categories with templates (for example two current hits, then a classic, then a jingle).": "",
 "The Show recorder saves what goes on air to files, for podcasts or your logs. Both are in the Tools menu.": "",
 "The best copy (lossless, then highest bitrate) is kept; pick another with its button. Untick a group to leave it alone.": "",
 "The buttons at the top left play, pause, stop and skip to the next track. Vol is the master volume, and Fade sets how one track blends into the next.": "",
 "The coloured boxes show the last track, the track on air and what's coming up next.": "",
