 "The playlist that is on air can't be closed": "",
 "The portal needs a port of its own.": "",
 "The portal signs in with the server's username and password. These change when the server starts again.": "",
 "The program gets 16-bit 44.1 kHz stereo PCM on its input and must write the stream to its output. {bitrate} = the bitrate in kbps.": "",
 "The queue is empty.": "",
 "The same as Auto-fill from library in the playlist. It's for the whole station, not just this rule.": "",
 "The server has no sound cards.": "",
 "The server keeps its own sound cards, remote control and plugin settings. Paths left unmapped stay as they are.": "",
 "The server was started with --no-audio, so it streams only until it is started without it.": "",
 "The song on air fades out and the break starts on time. A countdown lets the presenter play it now, snooze it or skip it.": "",
 "The song on air will fade out.": "",
 "The station goes quiet while the server restarts (a few seconds) — best done between shows. This app reconnects by itself.": "",
 "The template's times of day follow the clock from where the new tracks start.": "",
